    "creator": "Saar Haghi",
    "text": "new tesst:\n\nreward rush for user behind in DP\n@sahar shtekel \n@Aviv Major",
    "replies": []
   },
   {
    "update_id": "4614024174",
    "created_at": "2025-10-27T12:23:15.000Z",
    "updated_at": "2025-10-27T12:23:15.000Z",
    "creator": "Aviram Shwarzbard",
    "text": "Lets do 18 steps instead of 12. If it works we can try more.",
    "replies": []
   },
   {
    "update_id": "4612116974",
    "created_at": "2025-10-25T15:10:35.000Z",
    "updated_at": "2025-10-25T15:10:35.000Z",
    "creator": "Eden Elmaliach",
    "text": "https://superplay.monday.com/protected_static/3769936/resources/2510313435/4dfbd0977379461bc60bb0609...",
    "replies": []
   },
   {
    "update_id": "4612116795",
    "created_at": "2025-10-25T15:10:00.000Z",
    "updated_at": "2025-10-25T15:42:23.000Z",
    "creator": "Eden Elmaliach",
    "text": "Goal:\n\nBoost player motivation and sense of progress by having 24 easier missions instead of 12.\n\nIdea:\n\nMore small wins and visible locked rewards encourage players to buy the Premium Pass, even though total rewards stay the same.\n\nSetup:\n\nControl – 12 missions\n\nTest – 24 easier missions\n\nMeasure:\n\nPremium Pass purchase rate, completion, and engagement.\n4dfbd0977379461bc60bb06097e186a1.mp4",
    "replies": [
     {
      "created_at": "2025-10-25T15:42:23.000Z",
      "creator": "Eden Elmaliach",
      "text": "In essence, expanding to 32 levels is a strategy to keep players engaged for longer, increase the perceived value of the paid pass, and create a more compelling reward journey that can be tailored to different player spending habits."
     }
    ]
   }
  ]
 },
